      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"is entitled to the passport, has met the standard of evidence for both identity and citizenship\",\"actor\":\"the applicant\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[\"You must issue the passport application if the applicant is entitled to the passport, has met the standard of evidence for both identity and citizenship, the passport application is acceptable in its totality, and there are no other barriers to issuance.\"],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5dac520daac2bef27882501fea93e2d387c145753f5d569efecf31107c2eb967\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d94ce8b878b212587e90f3a8795dd8098244469be0c52292cf0ec470d07ebacb\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3dc5f5946d20a7f7538bde92f81d348d0d51f7a1627e9e3f18ff6cc1628da1f7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:777996c92fb7c549b966aab7339afd556049948c77f04aa3d81275cc00f53948\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c3c54a92c1196fbba0270ea5363c899337b68a6bc908e9ae47d83ee5e4b7a868\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:453883b92b0e06aee5f2f36556db8909da22fe644052d33f112a2bd1eb776e40\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:68ec14a18ab8754c43e547f1ff2fbf21e38e4403d8bb01e04db7e3abc4b23133\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6272efee20674d72a65a2cda147a4bf94ebc96b3f3f7b5dd4908b77629ab17d4\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:9518c9e2c01ea01b01cf7529bfaeeb034c10a1f30db48f8251998149cee356f1\"],\"choice_quote\":\"both identity and citizenship\",\"choice_text\":\"both identity and citizenship\",\"context_quotes\":[],\"end\":1276,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1276,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Ac18560fe79c0a5c89b4be4844b696ec79555b0efe6f3bdedf4f3008774d6a8b1:1063:1276:sha256-1cc605768d1133bab01f13411f1f8e50a001ada02dfe3ee9fbe6fed5d4c91058\",\"quote\":\"if the applicant is entitled to the p